<!-- SLIDE 1 / ARC -->
<section class="hero-slide" data-tone="core" aria-label="GMS ARC architecture"><div class="hero-inner"><div class="hero-copy"><div class="hero-top eyebrow"><i class="dot"></i> GMS / ARC — A NEW CLASS OF RESILIENCE</div><h1 class="hero-title"><span>Intelligence.</span><span>Beyond</span><span><em>limits.</em></span></h1><p class="hero-lead">Meet GMS / ARC: an integrated architecture for edge intelligence that must continue to function when the environment stops being predictable.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button" href="#/platform">Discover GMS / ARC <span class="arrow">↗</span></a><a class="text-link secondary-link" href="#/portfolio">Explore the system family ↗</a></div><div class="hero-meta">01 / 04 — RESILIENT INTELLIGENCE, REIMAGINED</div></div><div class="hero-vis" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 850 750"><defs><linearGradient id="s1a" x1="0" x2="1" y1="0" y2="1"><stop stop-color="var(--surface-blue)"/><stop offset=".32" stop-color="var(--art-blue-light)"/><stop offset=".62" stop-color="var(--art-blue)"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="var(--art-navy)"/></linearGradient><linearGradient id="s1b" x1=".2" y1=".2" x2="1" y2="1"><stop stop-color="var(--art-white)"/><stop offset=".55" stop-color="var(--art-blue-light)"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="var(--text-secondary)"/></linearGradient><filter id="shadow1"><feGaussianBlur stdDeviation="22"/></filter></defs><ellipse cx="450" cy="630" rx="235" ry="35" fill="var(--art-navy)" opacity=".13" filter="url(#shadow1)"/><g class="float"><g transform="translate(428 364) rotate(-25)"><ellipse rx="265" ry="165" fill="none" stroke="var(--art-navy)" stroke-opacity=".17"/><ellipse rx="305" ry="200" fill="none" stroke="var(--art-navy)" stroke-opacity=".09"/><ellipse rx="230" ry="230" fill="none" stroke="url(#s1a)" stroke-width="81"/><ellipse rx="230" ry="230" fill="none" stroke="url(#s1b)" stroke-width="22" stroke-opacity=".85"/><ellipse rx="126" ry="126" fill="url(#s1a)" opacity=".95"/><ellipse rx="62" ry="62" fill="